	\n\n\n\naugust 3 – 9:30 am\n\n\n\n\n\n\n10:30 am Classes\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
	June 1 – 10:30 am\n\n\n\n\n\nJune 8 – 10:30 am\n\n\n\n\n\nJune 15 – 10:30 
	am\n\n\n\n\n\nJune 22 – 10:30 am\n\n\n\n\n\nJune 29 – 10:30 am\n\n\n\n\n\n
	July 6 – 10:30 am\n\n\n\n\n\nJuly 13 – 10:30 am\n\n\n\n\n\nJuly 20 – 10:30
	 am\n\n\n\n\n\nJuly 27 – 10:30 am\n\n\n\n\n\naugust 3 – 10:30 am\n\n\n\n\n
	\n\nPlease come dressed for the outdoors\, including closed-toe shoes.  \n
