DESCRIPTION:Last night\, one team punched its ticket to the Final. Tonight\
	, the other spot is up for grabs. The tension is real\, the stakes are eve
	rything\, and we wouldn’t watch it anywhere else but here with you. \nKick
	off for this free event is at 2:00 p.m. \nFood and Beverage Concessions: V
	isit Franky’s for a gourmet hot dog or sausage\, and cool down with Frios 
	Gourmet Pops. Non-alcoholic drinks from Coca-Cola as well as pre-packaged 
	snacks can be purchased at the Community Partner Concessions Booth\, proce
	eds benefiting Levy Park and the event’s community partners. You can also 
	stop by the park’s full-time concessionaires: Kind Ice Cream\, Hearsay\, a
	nd Gaspachos. \nActivities: Get into the tournament spirit with face and b
	ody art from Butterfly Faces\, Henna by Kenza\, try your hand at our bubbl
	e stations\, and enjoy coloring pages from featured teams. \nMerchandise: 
	Event merchandise celebrating Houston\, Levy Park\, and the global soccer 
	tournament will also be available for purchase. \nArt Installations and Ph
	oto Opportunities: Commemorate the experience with a photo tour of the par
	k\, including life-sized soccer-themed photo backdrops and a tournament br
	acket. Visit our soccer ball music box and turn the crank for festive soun
	ds.\n\nhttps://www.levyparkhouston.org/events/semifinals-2/\n\nFrom Levy P
	ark Houston
